    <h2>DQ Shake Flavors — All Options</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Chocolate</strong> — The classic, most popular shake at DQ</li>
      <li><strong>Vanilla</strong> — Clean, creamy, pairs with any meal</li>
      <li><strong>Strawberry</strong> — Fresh strawberry flavor, 710+ cal (small)</li>
      <li><strong>Peanut Butter</strong> — Rich and indulgent, high-calorie option</li>
      <li><strong>Hot Fudge</strong> — Warm fudge blended into the shake base</li>
      <li><strong>Caramel</strong> — Sweet caramel swirled through the shake</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Malts are available for any shake flavor — a malt adds malted milk powder for a slightly tangy, deeper flavor at approximately the same price.</p>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
