<section class="section"><div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
<h2>DQ Drinks — Ordering Strategy</h2>
<p>Choose your DQ drink based on what you want the drink to do alongside your meal. A <a href="/items/misty-slush">Misty Slush</a> is purely refreshing and the cheapest option. A <a href="/items/chocolate-shake">shake</a> is a thick, substantial drink that functions almost as a dessert alongside your food. A <a href="/items/moolatte">MooLatté</a> is for coffee lovers who want their caffeine in frozen dessert form. A <a href="/items/fruit-smoothies">smoothie</a> or <a href="/items/orange-julius">Orange Julius</a> is the freshest, most wholesome drink option. Browse the complete DQ menu on <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>.</p>
<h2>Drinks That Pair Best With DQ Food</h2>
<ul><li>With a <a href="/items/flamethrower-stackburger">FlameThrower Stackburger</a> — <a href="/items/chocolate-shake">Chocolate Shake</a> or Misty Slush cools the spice</li>
<li>With a <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Basket</a> — classic fountain soft drink pairs cleanly</li>
<li>With a <a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">cheeseburger</a> — any option works; Vanilla Shake adds dessert value</li>
<li>After a full meal as dessert — <a href="/items/moolatte">MooLatté Mocha</a> is the best post-meal coffee option</li></ul>
</div></section>

